 "_method": [
  "Share of homes whose MAIN space heating equipment is a heat pump, by state.",
  "Computed from EIA RECS 2020 public-use microdata - NOT the published state",
  "highlights table, which counts CENTRAL heat pumps only and omits mini-splits.",
  "",
  "  primary          EQUIPM in {4 central heat pump, 13 ductless mini-split},",
  "                   weighted by NWEIGHT, denominator = all occupied homes.",
  "  any              adds homes running a mini-split as SECONDARY heat (EQUIPAUXTYPE 13).",
  "  gap              any - primary. Homes with a mini-split beside another main system.",
  "  companionFuels   main heating fuel of those gap homes, most common first.",
  "                   Second fuel listed only when it is at least 30% of that group.",
  "  rse              relative standard error, 60 replicate weights (Fay, rho=0.5).",
  "                   Above 25 is too noisy to publish; only HI and AK exceed it.",
  "",
  "Validation: reproduces EIA's published national figure of 14%.",
  "Source: https://www.eia.gov/consumption/residential/data/2020/index.php?view=microdata"
